{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "倍", "id": "倍"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "序", "id": "序"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "耕", "id": "耕"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "葬", "id": "葬"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.8526314299133175, "source": "上", "target": "葬"}, {"weight": 2.8526314299133175, "source": "出", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "禮", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "禮", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "禮", "target": "葬"}, {"weight": 2.005333569526114, "source": "禮", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 1.2431935174792172, "source": "禮", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.6486586255873816, "source": "禮", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.8526314299133175, "source": "禮", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "葬", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.8526314299133175, "source": "葬", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.9512437185814275, "source": "倍", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 3.258096538021482, "source": "倍", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.6984807500860595, "source": "倍", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 0.32690278560506225, "source": "君", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.629487878599108, "source": "君", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "死", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 2.005333569526114, "source": "師", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 1.530875589930998, "source": "